@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
allowmixing
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
title Notification configuration boundary

component "External properties" as Properties
class "NotificationChannelsConfig\n(setup composition)" as Setup
class NotificationChannelComposition
class NotificationPreferenceService

class LendingServiceImpl
interface NotificationService
class SMSNotificationService
class EmailNotificationService
class WebhookNotificationService
interface ReaderRepository

Properties --> Setup : enabled channel identifiers
Setup --> NotificationChannelComposition : installed channels (identifier -> supplier)\nand configured identifiers

NotificationChannelComposition ..> SMSNotificationService : instantiates if enabled
NotificationChannelComposition ..> EmailNotificationService : instantiates if enabled
NotificationChannelComposition ..> WebhookNotificationService : instantiates if enabled

Setup --> LendingServiceImpl : inject enabled instances\n(as NotificationService)
LendingServiceImpl --> NotificationService : notify on enabled channels\nchosen by the reader
LendingServiceImpl --> ReaderRepository : reads chosen channels

Setup --> NotificationPreferenceService : inject enabled instances
NotificationPreferenceService --> ReaderRepository : stores chosen channels\n(rejects disabled ones)

SMSNotificationService ..|> NotificationService
EmailNotificationService ..|> NotificationService
WebhookNotificationService ..|> NotificationService
@enduml
